    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Rehearse your side of a counter visit. Start with hello, request a coffee politely, then say thank you. Leave breaks between the three parts. Retrieve the expressions in a useful order without rushing.",
