      "text": "Let's stack everything. You walk into a shop at three o'clock. Olá, boa tarde. Queria um café, por favor. — I wanted a coffee, please. São três. You sit down. Queria um café e um pastel. — I wanted a coffee and a cake. Quatro euros. Obrigado. You used greetings, politeness, numbers, and time in one real transaction.",
